# CODEOWNERS — auto-request review based on path
# Format: <path>  @user-or-team
# Last matching rule wins, so order from general → specific.
# Paths must be TRACKED files — a gitignored path (docs/SECRETS.md) matches nothing.
# Matching is case-sensitive: AGENTS.md and agents.md are different files.

*                           @your-org/maintainers

# --- High-sensitivity areas — always require a maintainer review ---
.github/workflows/          @your-org/maintainers
.husky/                     @your-org/maintainers
.gitleaks.toml              @your-org/maintainers
.coderabbit.yaml            @your-org/maintainers
prisma/migrations/          @your-org/maintainers
AGENTS.md                   @your-org/maintainers
